        <mxCell id="legenda" value="&lt;b&gt;Cauze&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1: 10 ≤ suma ≤ 5000&lt;br&gt;C2: suma % 10 == 0&lt;br&gt;C3: suma ≤ sold&lt;br&gt;C4: client premium&lt;br&gt;C5: suma ≤ sold + 1000&lt;br&gt;C6: retrasAzi + suma ≤ 5000&lt;br&gt;C7: retrasAzi + suma ≤ 10000&lt;br&gt;C8: stocul permite compunerea sumei&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Noduri intermediare&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;V = C1 ∧ C2 (suma valida)&lt;br&gt;F = C3 ∨ (C4 ∧ C5) (fonduri suficiente)&lt;br&gt;L = C6 ∨ (C4 ∧ C7) (in limita zilnica)&lt;br&gt;OK = V ∧ F ∧ L&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Efecte&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;E1 = ~V : SUMA_INVALIDA&lt;br&gt;E2 = V ∧ ~F : FONDURI_INSUFICIENTE&lt;br&gt;E3 = V ∧ F ∧ ~L : LIMITA_DEPASITA&lt;br&gt;E4 = OK ∧ ~C8 : BANCNOTE_INSUFICIENTE&lt;br&gt;E5 = OK ∧ C8 : SUCCES&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Constrangeri&lt;/b&gt;: C3 R C5, C6 R C7&lt;br&gt;~ = NOT, ∧ = AND, ∨ = OR" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;spacing=8;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="40" width="360" height="600" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
